      "content": "I don't know. It's hard to call it laziness when I feel so finished. It's more like... a sense of completion. You talk about ruin and broken narratives, but what if there's a certain dignity in leaving while the music is still beautiful? Instead of just waiting around to watch myself fade away into something uninspired and tired. Is there really any value in the decay?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
